Example Data Files
==================

This directory contains example data files for the LandscapeLTR package.

example_ltr_data.tsv
--------------------
A sample TSV file containing LTR retrotransposon annotations. This file can be used
with the plot_ltr_landscape() function to demonstrate package functionality.

File format:
- Tab-separated values
- Required columns: TE, Clade, Strand
- TE format: "Chr:Start-End" (e.g., "Chr01:10056333-10060920")

Usage:
  library(LandscapeLTR)
  data_file <- system.file("extdata", "example_ltr_data.tsv", package = "LandscapeLTR")
  plot_ltr_landscape(data_file, target_region = c(10.0, 11.0))

